From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:40:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: supply: apple,d2365-charger: Drop
 redundant reg constraints
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The fixed two-entry items list already constrains the count; the extra
minItems/maxItems fail current dt-schema meta-schema validation.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 74463632 (J71t ledger 5.3); unchanged]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml   | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml
index b2bc18fd6..bcc8575ad 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml
@@ -25,8 +25,6 @@ properties:
           - const: apple,d2365-charger
 
   reg:
-    minItems: 2
-    maxItems: 2
     items:
       - description: Charger status register bank.
       - description: Charger control register bank.
